'tests/fail_typecheck_vec_eq.pyk' 9:6-9:26 Type error: `==` cannot be
  applied to Vec(Int) and Vec(Int); it accepts Int == Int or Float ==
  Float or String == String or Char == Char or Bool == Bool. Vecs are
  compared with 'same(a, b)', which asks whether they are one Vec, or
  with 'vec.equal(a, b)' from lib/vec, which compares their elements
